  A["a constant model of a curve at a point is its height<br/>alone, and it is wrong as soon as you move"]
  A --> B["adding the slope gives the tangent line, which agrees<br/>with the function in value and in direction"]
  B --> C["adding the curvature gives a parabola, which agrees<br/>in value, in direction and in how it bends"]
